= The Resistance

Millions march in cities across the country the day after the inauguration. A new kind of opposition is born: decentralized, female-led, and furious.

- @resist_channel: Channel the energy into elections
- @resist_noncollab: Embrace total opposition
- @resist_selective: Oppose selectively and legislate where we can

@resist_channel
on-arrival: dem_enthusiasm += 1.2; civic_strength += 500; dem_legislatures += 0; progressive_strength += 2

We convert marches into volunteer lists, candidate recruitment, and voter registration.

@resist_noncollab
on-arrival: dem_enthusiasm += 1.5; polarization += 2; progressive_dissent -= 4; moderate_dissent += 3; gopmod_relation -= 5

Our base cheers; bipartisan deals become harder.

@resist_selective
on-arrival: moderate_strength += 2; gopmod_relation += 3; suburban_dem += 2*(1-dissent); progressive_dissent += 5; dem_enthusiasm += 0.3

We fight on the biggest issues and cut deals on others.
